JSON string.'=>'该值必须是 JSON 字符串。','The JSON must be a list of channels.'=>'该 JSON 必须是渠道列表。','the sc_wpun_channels filter'=>'sc_wpun_channels 过滤器','Channel %d repeats the id of an earlier channel and was skipped.'=>'渠道 %d 与之前的渠道 ID 重复，已跳过。','Channel %d is not valid and was skipped.'=>'渠道 %d 无效，已跳过。','Some configuration values supplied from outside the database are not valid. Invalid settings fall back to the saved value; a channel with an invalid value does not send until it is fixed.'=>'从数据库外部提供的部分配置值无效。无效的设置将回退为已保存的值；含有无效值的渠道在修复前不会发送。','WP Updates Notifier cannot use some configuration values'=>'WP Updates Notifier 无法使用部分配置值','Some values supplied by constants, environment variables or other sources are not valid. Invalid settings fall back to the saved value; a channel with an invalid value does not send until it is fixed.'=>'由常量、环境变量或其他来源提供的部分值无效。无效的设置将回退为已保存的值；含有无效值的渠道在修复前不会发送。','Review the notification settings'=>'检查通知设置','the sc_wpun_config_value filter'=>'sc_wpun_config_value 过滤器','The value is not valid for this setting, so the default is used.'=>'该值对此设置无效，因此使用默认值。','The value is not valid for this setting, so the saved one is used.'=>'该值对此设置无效，因此使用已保存的值。','The value is not valid for this field.'=>'该值对此字段无效。','The value is not a recognised on or off value (1, true, yes, on, 0, false, no, off), so environment variables are not read.'=>'该值不是可识别的开/关值（1, true, yes, on, 0, false, no, off），因此不会读取环境变量。','Every entry must implement WPUN\\Config_Source.'=>'每个条目都必须实现 WPUN\\Config_Source。','a configuration source'=>'配置源','constant %s'=>'常量 %s','This channel cannot send a test message.'=>'此渠道无法发送测试消息。','This channel is switched off.'=>'此渠道已关闭。','The "%s" channel did not return a Delivery_Result.'=>'“%s”渠道未返回 Delivery_Result。','The "%s" channel failed with an error.'=>'“%s”渠道因错误而失败。','The channel is misconfigured: %s is not valid.'=>'渠道配置有误：%s 无效。','The "%1$s" channel is not available: %2$s'=>'“%1$s”渠道不可用：%2$s','The "%s" channel is not available.'=>'“%s”渠道不可用。','The display "%1$s" cannot show several choices, so "%2$s" is used.'=>'显示方式“%1$s”无法显示多个选项，因此改用“%2$s”。','The display "%1$s" cannot show a single choice, so "%2$s" is used.'=>'显示方式“%1$s”无法显示单个选项，因此改用“%2$s”。','environment variable %s'=>'环境变量 %s','The field type "%s" must be an array with a callable "render" and a callable "sanitize", so it is ignored.'=>'字段类型“%s”必须是包含可调用的“render”和“sanitize”的数组，因此已被忽略。','No field type "%s" is registered, so the field is ignored. Register it with the sc_wpun_field_types filter.'=>'未注册字段类型“%s”，因此该字段已被忽略。请使用 sc_wpun_field_types 过滤器注册。','Enter a full web address that starts with http:// or https://.'=>'请输入以 http:// 或 https:// 开头的完整网址。','One or more email addresses are not valid.'=>'一个或多个电子邮件地址无效。','Enter a whole number.'=>'请输入整数。','Enter a number that is at least %d.'=>'请输入不小于 %d 的数字。','Enter a number that is at most %d.'=>'请输入不大于 %d 的数字。','The choice for "%s" is not valid.'=>'“%s”的选择无效。','%s is required.'=>'%s为必填项。','The value for "%s" is not valid.'=>'“%s”的值无效。','WordPress'=>'WordPress','The mute was refused.'=>'静音被拒绝。','The mute was refused: it is for another item.'=>'静音被拒绝：它针对的是另一个项目。','That item is not muted.'=>'该项目未静音。','That mute is set in code and cannot be removed here.'=>'该静音设置在代码中，无法在此移除。','Removing the mute was refused.'=>'移除静音被拒绝。','WordPress core cannot be muted. Use the core notification setting instead.'=>'无法将 WordPress 核心静音。请改用核心通知设置。','That kind of item cannot be muted.'=>'无法将此类项目静音。','Say which item to mute.'=>'请指定要静音的项目。','The version to skip cannot be empty.'=>'要跳过的版本不能为空。','That mute is set in code and cannot be changed here.'=>'该静音设置在代码中，无法在此更改。','…and %d more'=>'…以及另外 %d 项','Reminder: these updates are still waiting for %1$s (%2$s)'=>'提醒：%1$s（%2$s）仍有以下更新待处理','There are updates available for %1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s（%2$s）有可用更新','%1$s from version %2$s to %3$s'=>'%1$s 从版本 %2$s 更新到 %3$s','Please visit %s to update.'=>'请访问 %s 进行更新。','Go to the Updates screen to update.'=>'请前往“更新”页面进行更新。','Details'=>'详情','Changelog'=>'更新日志','%s details'=>'%s 详情','%s changelog'=>'%s 更新日志','WP Updates Notifier: updates available for %s'=>'WP Updates Notifier：%s 有可用更新','Some notification modules need a newer version of WP Updates Notifier and are switched off. Their settings have been kept.'=>'部分通知模块需要更新版本的 WP Updates Notifier，已被关闭。其设置已保留。','Some WP Updates Notifier modules need a newer version'=>'部分 WP Updates Notifier 模块需要更新的版本','Some notification modules need a newer version of WP Updates Notifier than this site has, so they are switched off. Their settings have been kept.'=>'部分通知模块需要比此站点更新的 WP Updates Notifier 版本，因此已被关闭。其设置已保留。','Update WP Updates Notifier'=>'更新 WP Updates Notifier','Item types'=>'项目类型','Leave every box unticked to receive all types, including ones added later.'=>'不勾选任何复选框即可接收所有类型，包括以后添加的类型。','Plugins and themes'=>'插件和主题','Applies after the plugin and theme settings on the General tab.'=>'在“常规”选项卡中的插件和主题设置之后应用。','All'=>'全部','Only active ones'=>'仅已启用的','WordPress updates'=>'WordPress 更新','Applies after the WordPress updates setting on the General tab.'=>'在“常规”选项卡中的 WordPress 更新设置之后应用。','Only major releases'=>'仅主要版本','Reminders'=>'提醒','Repeat every update that is still waiting, in one message, until it is installed. New updates are still sent at once.'=>'将所有仍待处理的更新合并在一条消息中重复提醒，直到安装为止。新的更新仍会立即发送。','Daily'=>'每天','Weekly'=>'每周','Frequency to check'=>'检查频率','Update notice'=>'更新提示','Hide the WordPress update notice from users who cannot update WordPress'=>'对无法更新 WordPress 的用户隐藏 WordPress 更新提示','About tab'=>'“关于”选项卡','Notify about WordPress updates?'=>'是否通知 WordPress 更新？','Yes, but only major releases'=>'是，但仅限主要版本','Notify about plugin updates?'=>'是否通知插件更新？','Notify about theme updates?'=>'是否通知主题更新？','Yes, but only active plugins'=>'是，但仅限已启用的插件','Yes, but only active themes'=>'是，但仅限已启用的主题','WP Updates Notifier checks for updates'=>'WP Updates Notifier 会检查更新','WP-Cron is switched off for WP Updates Notifier'=>'已为 WP Updates Notifier 关闭 WP-Cron','WP Updates Notifier has a channel to send through'=>'WP Updates Notifier 有可用于发送的渠道','The modules of the WP Updates Notifier channels are available'=>'WP Updates Notifier 渠道的模块可用','The last notification of each WP Updates Notifier channel was delivered'=>'WP Updates Notifier 各渠道的上次发送均已成功','The update check is not scheduled, so no update will be reported.'=>'未计划更新检查，因此不会报告任何更新。','The update checks are not running. The next one is long overdue and none ran lately. WP-Cron may not be running on this site.'=>'更新检查未在运行。下一次检查已严重逾期，且近期没有运行过任何检查。WP-Cron 可能未在此站点上运行。','The update check is scheduled and running.'=>'更新检查已计划并正在运行。','WP Updates Notifier is not checking for updates'=>'WP Updates Notifier 没有检查更新','WP Updates Notifier checks run from a server cron'=>'WP Updates Notifier 的检查通过服务器 cron 运行','WP-Cron is switched off, and the update checks are running from a server cron.'=>'WP-Cron 已关闭，更新检查正通过服务器 cron 运行。','WP-Cron is switched off, so WP Updates Notifier may not check'=>'WP-Cron 已关闭，因此 WP Updates Notifier 可能不会检查','DISABLE_WP_CRON is set and no update check ran lately. Make a server cron request wp-cron.php regularly, or run "wp updates-notifier check" from a server cron.'=>'已设置 DISABLE_WP_CRON，且近期没有运行过更新检查。请让服务器 cron 定期请求 wp-cron.php，或通过服务器 cron 运行 "wp updates-notifier check"。','At least one channel is switched on and can send.'=>'至少有一个渠道已开启并且可以发送。','WP Updates Notifier has no channel to send through'=>'WP Updates Notifier 没有可用于发送的渠道','No channel is switched on and able to send, so nothing will be sent. Switch a channel on if you want to be told about updates.'=>'没有已开启且能够发送的渠道，因此不会发送任何内容。如果想收到更新通知，请开启一个渠道。','Every channel that is switched on has its module.'=>'每个已开启的渠道都有其模块。','Some WP Updates Notifier channels cannot send'=>'WP Updates Notifier 的部分渠道无法发送','These channels are switched on, but their module is not available, so nothing is sent through them. Activate the add-on that provides the module, or switch the channel off.'=>'这些渠道已开启，但其模块不可用，因此不会通过它们发送任何内容。请启用提供该模块的附加组件，或关闭该渠道。','No channel that is switched on failed its last delivery.'=>'没有已开启的渠道在上次发送时失败。','Some WP Updates Notifier channels failed to deliver'=>'WP Updates Notifier 的部分渠道发送失败','The last delivery of these channels failed. The update will be tried again at the next check.'=>'这些渠道上次发送失败。将在下次检查时重试该更新。','Check frequency'=>'检查频率','Next check'=>'下次检查','Last check'=>'上次检查','WP-Cron switched off (DISABLE_WP_CRON)'=>'WP-Cron 已关闭 (DISABLE_WP_CRON)','set in code'=>'在代码中设置','None'=>'无','Configuration problem'=>'配置问题','Availability'=>'可用性','Next try after'=>'下次重试时间不早于','Frequency: %s'=>'频率：%s','Last check: %s'=>'上次检查：%s','Email notifications continue as before.'=>'电子邮件通知将照常继续。','Email notifications are switched off, so this site currently sends no update notifications. You can turn them on at %s'=>'电子邮件通知已关闭，因此此站点目前不会发送任何更新通知。您可以在 %s 开启','Slack notifications are not supported in this version of WP Updates Notifier. Your Slack settings have been kept.'=>'此版本的 WP Updates Notifier 不支持 Slack 通知。您的 Slack 设置已保留。','New notification channels and features are coming in future releases.'=>'新的通知渠道和功能将在未来版本中推出。','WP Updates Notifier: Slack notifications are no longer supported'=>'WP Updates Notifier：不再支持 Slack 通知','Slack notifications are no longer supported'=>'不再支持 Slack 通知','Dismiss this notice'=>'忽略此通知','Slack notifications are no longer supported by WP Updates Notifier'=>'WP Updates Notifier 不再支持 Slack 通知','Slack notifications are not supported in this version of WP Updates Notifier, so none are sent. Your Slack settings have been kept.'=>'此版本的 WP Updates Notifier 不支持 Slack 通知，因此不会发送。您的 Slack 设置已保留。','always'=>'始终','version %s'=>'版本 %s','not scheduled'=>'未计划','never'=>'从未','rejected: %s'=>'已拒绝：%s','unknown module'=>'未知模块','success'=>'成功','failure'=>'失败','not set'=>'未设置','set'=>'已设置','The filter must return a WPUN\\Notification.'=>'过滤器必须返回 WPUN\\Notification。','Compatibility with WordPress %s: unknown'=>'与 WordPress %s 的兼容性：未知','Compatibility with WordPress %s: tested by its author'=>'与 WordPress %s 的兼容性：已由作者测试','Compatibility with WordPress %1$s: not tested yet (tested up to %2$s)'=>'与 WordPress %1$s 的兼容性：尚未测试（已测试至 %2$s）','Warning: this version needs PHP %1$s; the site runs PHP %2$s.'=>'警告：此版本需要 PHP %1$s；此站点运行的是 PHP %2$s。','Warning: this version needs WordPress %1$s; the site runs WordPress %2$s.'=>'警告：此版本需要 WordPress %1$s；此站点运行的是 WordPress %2$s。','The version "%s" could not be read. Use one to three numbers, such as "1.2.0".'=>'无法读取版本“%s”。请使用一到三个数字，例如“1.2.0”。','The version constraint "%s" could not be read. Use Composer syntax, such as "^1.0" or ">=1.0 <2.0".'=>'无法读取版本约束“%s”。请使用 Composer 语法，例如“^1.0”或“>=1.0 <2.0”。','No channel instance is switched on and available, so there is nobody to notify.'=>'没有已开启且可用的渠道实例，因此没有可通知的对象。','%d channel instance failed.'=>'%d 个渠道实例失败。','Dry run finished, nothing was sent or changed. %d channel instance would be sent a message.'=>'试运行完成，未发送或更改任何内容。将向 %d 个渠道实例发送消息。','Check finished. %d channel instance was sent a message.'=>'检查完成。已向 %d 个渠道实例发送消息。','There is no channel instance "%s".'=>'没有渠道实例“%s”。','test message sent'=>'测试消息已发送','No channel instance is switched on, available and able to send a test message.'=>'没有已开启、可用且能发送测试消息的渠道实例。','%d test message could not be sent.'=>'%d 条测试消息发送失败。','%d test message sent.'=>'已发送 %d 条测试消息。','Schedule'=>'计划','Settings of %s'=>'%s 的设置','Pending updates'=>'待处理的更新','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','%s is already muted that way.'=>'%s 已经以这种方式静音。','%s is not muted.'=>'%s 未静音。','Say whether the names are plugins or themes, then one or more names.'=>'请先指明名称是插件还是主题，然后给出一个或多个名称。','The plugin "%s" is not installed.'=>'插件“%s”未安装。','The theme "%s" is not installed.'=>'主题“%s”未安装。','%1$d of %2$d could not be changed.'=>'%2$d 个中有 %1$d 个无法更改。','%1$s cannot be used: %2$s.'=>'无法使用 %1$s：%2$s。','%s is switched off.'=>'%s已关闭。','switched off'=>'已关闭','waiting until %s'=>'等待至 %s','recorded without sending'=>'已记录但未发送','would send a reminder with %d item'=>'将发送包含 %d 项的提醒','sent a reminder with %d item'=>'已发送包含 %d 项的提醒','would send %d item'=>'将发送 %d 项','sent %d item'=>'已发送 %d 项','failed: %s'=>'失败：%s','the routing failed'=>'路由失败','nothing new'=>'没有新内容','Email'=>'电子邮件','Sends the notification to one or more email addresses.'=>'将通知发送到一个或多个电子邮件地址。','Send to'=>'发送至','Separate multiple email addresses with a comma (,).'=>'多个电子邮件地址请用英文逗号（,）分隔。','From address'=>'发件人地址','Leave empty to use the WordPress default. Only set an address at a domain this site is allowed to send mail for.'=>'留空则使用 WordPress 默认值。请仅设置此站点有权代为发送邮件的域名下的地址。','Reply-To address'=>'回复（Reply-To）地址','Format'=>'格式','Plain text'=>'纯文本','HTML'=>'HTML','Subject prefix'=>'邮件主题前缀','One or more email addresses to send to are invalid.'=>'一个或多个收件电子邮件地址无效。','Enter at least one valid email address to send to.'=>'请输入至少一个有效的收件电子邮件地址。','The email address is invalid.'=>'该电子邮件地址无效。','The format must be plain text or HTML.'=>'格式必须为纯文本或 HTML。','No email address to send to is set.'=>'未设置收件电子邮件地址。','WP Updates Notifier: test message for %s'=>'WP Updates Notifier：%s 的测试消息','This is a test message from WP Updates Notifier for %1$s (%2$s). Update notifications for this site will be sent to this address.'=>'这是一条来自 WP Updates Notifier、发给 %1$s（%2$s）的测试消息。此站点的更新通知将发送到此地址。','WP Updates Notifier: reminder of updates waiting for %s'=>'WP Updates Notifier：%s 的待处理更新提醒','WordPress could not send the email.'=>'WordPress 无法发送电子邮件。','The email could not be sent (%s).'=>'无法发送电子邮件（%s）。']];